ice  this vision you have for yourself this  ideal person you want to become  how does that person act start acting  like that person  today and you're gonna fall down and  it's okay you're gonna make mistakes  you're gonna forget you're not perfect  you're learning a new skill and like any  new skill to start you suck  right you suck at the beginning of  learning something new that's okay  it's to be expected but when you  practice and you commit to it and you do  something every day  to move forward on it pretty soon that  becomes your new habit  that replaces the old destructive habits  and you're doing more empowering things  and you're slowly becoming  that person that you want to become  that's how you stay aligned  that's how you stay focused because i  don't want you just watch a video  or read a book and say yeah wow that's  what i should do and then the next day  you wake up  and you forgot everything and you're  back to your old miserable life  change your environment and start taking  consistent  action towards your goals believe  for those of you watching like the video  give it a thumbs up below let me know  what you think leave a comment guys the  comments mean so much to me i wake up  every day and i look at the comments  that's how i start my day  i love seeing your comments so please  comment below if you have a question for  me  put it below i'll make a video response  and click on my face to subscribe to the  channel  see more videos like this thank you so  much i'll see you soon

